to the generator and ask it to explain them in the PR.>

n. Given any internal error, then EMPTY is returned and nothing is raised.
n+1. Every call prints one line in the form `[<module>] in=<...> out=<...>`.

MUST NOT

- Must not raise under any circumstance.
- Must not import <libraries out of scope for this version>.
- <Other forbidden outcomes, each one testable.>

VALIDATION

